title: "Traffic Signal Control with Deep Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >-
  A reference reinforcement-learning project: a Deep Q-Network controls a
  4-way intersection in the SUMO traffic simulator and is evaluated against
  fixed-time, max-pressure and random controllers on held-out traffic.
